    "text": "<p>Since, the intersection of two curves</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/80f98405-f09a-4775-8881-61be77488333-image.png\" style=\"width: 313px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sq</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>units</mi></math></p>",
